[{"content":[{"text":"You have a crafting table available as tools (place, take, clear_grid, craft), a 3x3 grid (slots 0-8, row-major), and an inventory. Your goal: craft a torch. Use the tools to do it, then report which tool calls you made, in order, and the final craft result.","type":"text"}],"createdAt":1795194376379,"generationStatus":"completed","id":"user-turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0-1","inputEntryId":null,"relatedEntryId":null,"role":"user","sessionId":"ff27578b-7c2e-25e2-16d9-a4ad5b6e00f4","source":"turn_start","turnId":"turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0","type":"message","updatedAt":1795194376379},{"createdAt":1795194379908,"generationStatus":"completed","id":"reasoning-d07ea02c-857a-5b45-b2d6-7d6821870a0f-0","inputEntryId":"user-turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0-1","outcome":{"type":"committed"},"relatedEntryId":null,"sessionId":"ff27578b-7c2e-25e2-16d9-a4ad5b6e00f4","summary":[],"text":"The user wants me to craft a torch using a crafting table. I need to:\n1. First understand what tools are available (place, take, clear_grid, craft)\n2. Understand the 3x3 grid layout (slots 0-8, row-major)\n3. Figure out the torch recipe in Minecraft (which is a stick on top of coal/charcoal, or in a crafting table it's coal/charcoal above a stick)\n4. Actually perform the crafting using the tools\n5. Report the tool calls made and the final result\n\nLet me start by searching for the tool functions to understand their signatures.","turnId":"turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0","type":"reasoning","updatedAt":1795194379908},{"createdAt":1795194379908,"detail":{"display":{"message":"Searching for relevant tools","settledMessage":"for relevant tools","settledVerb":"Searched","statusText":"Searching for relevant tools","summary":"Searching for relevant tools","verb":"Searching"},"input":{"mode":"best_match"},"kind":"tool","toolName":"search_tool_functions"},"generationStatus":"completed","id":"effect-tool-discovery-W2I9LUxLS","inputEntryId":"user-turn-a20