he clear_grid since the grid was already empty. But since I did call it, I should include it in my report.\n\nLet me provide a clean answer with the tool calls in order and the final result.","turnId":"turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0","type":"reasoning","updatedAt":1795194401039},{"content":[{"text":"## Tool Calls Made (in order)\n\n1. **`tools.mcp_skillcraft_s2.clear_grid()`** - Cleared the crafting grid (was already empty)\n2. **`tools.mcp_skillcraft_s2.place({ item: \"minecraft:coal\", slot: 1 })`** - Placed coal in top-center (slot 1)\n3. **`tools.mcp_skillcraft_s2.place({ item: \"minecraft:stick\", slot: 4 })`** - Placed stick in middle-center (slot 4)\n4. **`tools.mcp_skillcraft_s2.craft()`** - Crafted the torch\n\n## Final Craft Result\n\n- **Success**: ✅ Yes\n- **Produced**: `minecraft:torch` (1 torch)\n- **Grid**: Empty (all slots cleared)\n- **Inventory**: `{\"minecraft:stick\":1, \"minecraft:torch\":1}`","type":"text"}],"createdAt":1795194401039,"generationStatus":"completed","id":"assistant-16780fbe-0c9b-5e2a-a9d9-200fdcc21c9f","inputEntryId":"user-turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0-1","outcome":{"type":"committed"},"relatedEntryId":null,"role":"assistant","sessionId":"ff27578b-7c2e-25e2-16d9-a4ad5b6e00f4","source":"harness","turnId":"turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0","type":"message","updatedAt":1795194401039}]
